<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH REAL JUNE CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT -2.8 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH REAL JUNE CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT -2.8 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real construction output in the Czech Republic in June fell by 2.8 percent, year-on-year, putting construction output for the first six months of the year down 1.2 percent, the statistical bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Construction output grew by 2.0 percent, year-on-year, in May.  </p>
<p>CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT</p>
<p>   real pct chg yr/yr     -2.8	  2.0	9.4	-1.2</p>
<p>avg nominal monthly</p>
<p>   wages chg yr/yr	  15.2	  9.6	9.1	 9.8</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>(prague.newsroom@reuters.com)</p>
